{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L4--5 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: fill_marked_cells\n- L8--9 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: fill_marked_cells\n- L12--13 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: handoff_across_barrier\n- L16--17 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: handoff_across_barrier\n- L20--21 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: deliver_with_moving_carrier\n- L24--27 `def play_level_6(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_wa30_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_19jl4di`\n- L30--32 `def play_level_7(env):`; calls: clear_interfering_carrier, fill_marked_cells\n\n## legs.py\n- L6--111 `def fill_marked_cells(env, cell=4, cooperative=False, pickup_directions=(1,), target_signature=None, persistent_targets=False):` — Carry yellow pieces onto red cells, checking each delivery.; calls: RuntimeError, arr, deque, len, map, max, min, next, observe, range, +4\n- L114--222 `def handoff_across_barrier(env, cell=4):` — Stage side-carried pieces across a divider for an autonomous carrier.; calls: RuntimeError, any, arr, deque, len, map, max, min, next, observe, +5\n- L225--342 `def deliver_with_moving_carrier(env, cell=4, deliveries=3, max_steps=125):` — Deliver cargo while yielding contested passages to another carrier.; calls: RuntimeError, block_signatures, deque, enumerate, islice, len, max, min, navigate, next, +7\n- L345--418 `def clear_interfering_carrier(env, carrier_color=15, cell=4, max_steps=60, settle_turns=0):` — Approach a carrier, face it, and USE; verify removal before committing.; calls: RuntimeError, any, block_signatures, deque, len, max, next, step, tuple\n\n## perception.py\n- L23